OL,3,ANandy pledges crackdown on 'doxxing'
OL,4,Aafter RNLI volunteers see personal
OL,5,Adetails online
OL,6,
OL,7,FLisa Nandy has vowed to strengthen the
OL,8,Flaw on "doxxing" after lifeboat
OL,9,Fvolunteers involved in migrant crossing
OL,10,Frescues had their personal details
OL,11,Fpublished online.
OL,13,FThe culture secretary said she would
OL,14,F"tighten up the law" to make doxxing,
OL,15,Fwhich involves leaking people's home
OL,16,Faddresses, a criminal offence.
OL,18,FCurrently, she said this kind of
OL,19,Fbehaviour is only illegal if it is done
OL,20,Fwith clear intent to cause fear, harm
OL,21,Fand distress.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,308,300,200,140,0,100
